rune new revision opp-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 text 'hese operating policies and procedures are established and adopted under the authority granted in the Springfield Charter, Chapter IV, Section 12.'
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '2.1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 text 'first regular meeting of the Council in January of each odd - numbered year, the Council shall elect one of its members as President of the Common Council. The duties of President shall be those specified in the City Charter and any others expressly directed herein.'
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-2-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 summary '2.2 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 text ', City Recorder, and City Attorney are hereby entitled to seats with the Common Council.'
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-2-2-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 summary '2.3 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 text 'will declare that a vacancy has occurred at a regular meeting . Before filling a vacancy in an elective office as defined in the Springfield Charter and notwithstanding a situation where the Council appoints a councilor - elect to fill a vacancy in the seat to which they were elected before their term starts , the Council shall adopt a process that may include procedures such as determining qualifications, advertising and outreach regarding the vacancy, a standard application form, the interview process and public participation. The Council cannot adopt the process until the public has had an opportunity to provide comment about the process at a public hearing. The adopted process will not commence until after the vacating Councilor has vacated their position and ceased their role.'
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-2-3-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 text 'regular meetings of the Common Council shall be held in the Springfield City Hall, Council Chambers, 225 Fifth Street. Changes of location must be in accordance with City Code Section 2.050. 2'
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.2 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 text 'regular meetings shall begin at 7:00 p.m. on the first and third Mondays of each month, except when that day falls on a legal holiday in which event the Council shall meet on the next following regular business day at the same time and location. If adv ised by the City Manager or when approved by the Mayor or three members of the Council, special meetings may be scheduled. Regular meetings may be canceled sometime during the months of March, June, July and August in order to provide a time for spring bre ak or summer recess, and during the months of December and January to provide a time for a winter recess.'
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.3.1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 text '. Councilors are expected to attend all Council work sessions and regular meetings. The City Charter provides that the position of Mayor or a Council consecutive regular Council meetings (Springfield Charter Section 19(10)).'
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-3-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.3.2 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 text '. Excused absences from Council meetings include: 3. 3 . 2. 1 Death in the family 3. 3. 2.2 Illness 3. 3.2. 3 Family emergency 3. 3. 2.4 Scheduled vacations; however, Councilors are encouraged, when possible, to schedule vacations during scheduled Council recesses. 3. 3. 2.5 On city business 3. 3. 2.6 Employment conflict 3. 3. 2.7 Other absences as excused by the Mayor or three members of the Council when the Mayor is not available.'
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-3-2-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.3.3 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 text '. Councilors may, at their discretion, attend meetings, regular sessions, and work sessions in - person or virtually.'
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-3-3-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.4 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 text '3. 4. 1 Open to the Public . All meetings of the Council or the Boards, Committees, and Commissions of the City shall be open to the public and in conformance with Chapter 192, Oregon revised Statutes, Public Meetings.'
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-4-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.4.2 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 text 'with Disabilities . The meeting location shall be accessible to persons with disabilities . Up on request of a person who is deaf or heard of hearing, the City will make a good faith effort to provide an interpreter at a regularly scheduled meeting. The request shall be made at least 48 hours in advance and include the name of the requester and sign language preference. 3'
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-4-2-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.4.3 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 text '. For meetings in the Council well as the Induction Loop for the benefit of hearing aid users.'
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-4-3-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.5.1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 text '. Matters to be considered by the Council at its regular meetings shall be placed on an agenda to be prepared by the City Manager from the following materials:'
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-5-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.5.1.1 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 text 'items considered by the Council from work sessions which require official action of the Council.'
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-5-1-1-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.5.1.2 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 text 'items directed by the Mayor or a member of the Council to be listed on the agenda. Items recommended for discussion by the Mayor require approval of the Council President. Items recommended by the Council President require approval of the Mayor. If agr eement is not reached, Council consensus is required in order to add the item to the agenda. Items recommended for discussion by a Council member require approval of the Mayor and Council President. If agreement is not reached, a majority of the Council is required in order to add the item to the agenda.'
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
set opp-3-5-1-2-rev-2025-10-06 snapshot 'bbe386fef22770dcfe024ef9111557b6cf9aa7973d7509cdfc668f460fd9cf4b'
rune new revision opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06
set opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06 summary '3.5.1.3 as published 2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06 text 'items deemed appropriate to the City Manager.'
set opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06 adopted '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06 from '2025-10-06'
set opp-3-5-1-3-rev-2025-10-06 source_url 'Springfield OR City Council Operating Policies and Procedures, Oct 2025 (supplied by author; published by the City)'
